    - target: {fileID: 7129505182872729169, guid: 10501b26f631f2d4f9506b79346ff187, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<size=45%>GALLERY 04</size>

        Phillips CD-i

        <size=45%>1990

        Actually
        a disc storage format, but Phillips made most

        players for the format.

        Infamous
        for being the platform for Hotel Mario and three

        Legend of Zelda
        games, resulting from a deal

        with Nintendo.</size>'
