    - target: {fileID: 7129505182872729169, guid: 10501b26f631f2d4f9506b79346ff187, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<size=45%>GALLERY 01</size>

        Magnavox Odyssey

        <size=45%>1972

        The
        first commercial home video game console

        Was able to display a whopping
        three square dots and a line

        No ram, no sound, just games and your
        controllers

        Came with a bunch of plastic coverings that you could
        put onto the screen to augment

        the otherwise simple graphics</size>'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
